---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import site from '../site.config.ts';
---
<Page title="About" description={`About ${site.name}, a free tool that spreads increases and decreases evenly across a row.`}>
  <p>{site.name} spreads increases or decreases evenly across a knitted or crocheted row. You type the stitches you have and the number to add or remove. It writes the pattern line and draws your row.</p>
  <h2>Why we built it</h2>
  <p>Patterns say "increase 12 stitches evenly" and leave the sums to you. Many calculators for this are slow, hard to read on a phone, or full of pop-ups. We wanted one that opens fast, works with one hand, and gives a line you can copy.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>The tool runs in your browser. We do not ask you to create an account. It handles flat rows and work in the round, increases and decreases, and the common stitch names such as M1, YO, K2tog and SSK.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or ideas? Write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or visit the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
